{'symbol': 'IPGP', 'date': '2021-04-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'IPG PHOTONICS TO ANNOUNCE FIRST QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS ON MAY 4', 'text': "OXFORD, MASS., APRIL 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- IPG PHOT O N I CS CORPORATION \xa0(NASDAQ: IPGP) WILL RELEASE ITS FIRST QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS ON TUESDAY, MAY 4, 2021. THE COMPANY WILL HOLD A CONFERENCE CALL TO REVIEW THESE RESULTS AT 10:00 A.M. ET ON THE SAME DAY. TO ACCESS THE CALL, PLEASE DIAL 877-407-6184 IN THE UNITED STATES OR 201-389-0877 INTERNATIONALLY. A LIVE WEBCAST OF THE CALL WILL ALSO BE AVAILABLE AND ARCHIVED IN THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT\xa0 INVESTOR.IP G PH O TONICS.COM ."}